# Facts of "is this release newer than the one I run": the host folds the strings (parse X.Y.Z[-pre], compare the triples); the policy for pre-releases is the decision.
CONTRACT unitymcp.versionorder
COVERAGE declared-scope
MODULE version_facts
FACT ver.parsed bool
FACT ver.triple enum=less,equal,greater closed
FACT ver.candPre bool
FACT ver.curPre bool
INPUT isNewer ver.parsed ver.triple ver.candPre ver.curPre
